Package: spigot
Title: Plumber Endpoints Inside a Shiny App
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Kent", "Orr", , "orr.kent@pawpawanalytics.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Mounts a 'plumber' router inside a 'shiny' app so hand-written
    HTML/JavaScript pages can call R endpoints on the same origin and port,
    while 'shiny' provides hosting, per-tab sessions and server push.
